{title: Meri Bheegi Bheegi Si}
{artist: Kishore Kumar R D Burman}
{key: A#}

{c: Verse 1}
[A#m]Meri bheegi bheegi si        pal[D#m]kon pe reh gaye
[D#m]Jaise mere sapne bikhar[F]ke        Jale[A#m]man tera bhi
kisi[G#]ke milanko        [D#m]Anamika tu bhi[A#m]tarse

{c: Verse 1}
[A#m]Tujhe bin jaane bin pehchane        Maine[G#]hrudayse[A#m]lagaya
[G#]Par mere pyar ke[F#]badle mein toone        [F#]Mujhko yeh din[F]dikhlaya
[A#m]Jaise birha ki rut[G#]maine kaati        [F#]tadapke Aahen bhar[F]bharke
Jale[A#m]man tera bhi        kisi[G#]ke milanko
[D#m]Anamika tu bhi[A#m]tarse

{c: Verse 1}
[A#m]Aag se naata naari se rishta        Kaahe[G#]man samajh na[A#m]paaya
[G#]Mujhe kya hua tha[F#]ek bewafaa pe        [F#]Hai mujhe kyon pyaar[F]aaya
[A#m]Teri bewafaai pe[G#]hanse jag saara        [F#]Gali gali guzre[F]jidharse
Jale[A#m]man tera bhi        kisi[G#]ke milanko
[D#m]Anamika tu bhi[A#m]tarse

